				'Waiting List Cohort'[Gender] IN { "F" }
			) 
			/
			CALCULATE(
			    COUNT('Waiting List Cohort'[Pseudo_NHS_Number]))
			```
		lineageTag: 4e6d0b73-19d2-4bd6-928c-e769b135bd3a

